'''Nord Sword''' is the eighth, [[Deep North]]-tier [[Swords|sword]].

* The primary attack is a 3-hit combo with double damage on the last hit. No damage penalty against multiple targets.
* Its secondary attack deals 3x damage with a slightly longer reach.

It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding '''Cast Nord Sword''' and harden it in a [[Frost Foundry]]. 

== Mould ==
'''Mould: Nord Sword''' can be found:
* By destroying trash piles in [[Winding Tunnels]].
* In chests buried at [[Memorial Site]]s.
* From [[Barrel]]s in [[Abandoned Village]]s.
* By destroying weapon stands on the last floor of [[Mörkhalla]].

== Upgrade information ==
Like most Deep North-tier weapons, the Nord Sword can be upgraded into:

* {{item link|Frostfire Sword}} (with a [[Frostfire Essence]])
* {{item link|Thunderblood Sword}} (with a [[Thunderblood Essence]]).

An upgraded Nord Sword will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is modified using an essense.

